>
> So as I understand this definition, x1 can only fit into the predicate
> word =E2=80=9Ccmene=E2=80=9D if the quoted word(s) are actually the name =
of something.
>
> =E2=80=9Czo trolololololololololol cmene=E2=80=9D may be false, iff there=
 is actually
> nothing with this strange name.
>
> But most important, =E2=80=9Ccmene=E2=80=9D is all about the name of some=
thing. It does
